<title>USA: FSA qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies seven issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said it has qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Chandler, Ariz., $9.7 million general obligation refunding bonds and $5.275 million highway bonds.</p>
<p>--Emery USD, Calif., $2.690 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Somers, Mont., $2.5 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Hoosic Valley CSD, N.Y., $6.502 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Nassau County, N.Y., $185.365 million general improvement bonds and $4.715 million sewer district bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
